window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Meeting long-lost siblings should be awesome, right?</b></p> <p>Well, when you happen to be on the wrong side of the law and have every intention of staying there, having a cop for a sister isn’t exactly ideal. And teaming up with said sister? Well, that is just the cherry on top of the crap-tastic pie that has been my life.</p> <p>But, when our brother decides to attack us head on, banding together is the least of our problems. </p> <p><b>Because in our family? Being the hunter also means being the hunted.</b></p>"; 
